{"id":"c7cc05262ed121ec4f615cda483d0084cb28bceefb2b2c330b043f5dc66b557d","pubkey":"f16bdd644ebcf4971ac3d2248afc94aabea896e9836338cf6d85911aa183442e","created_at":1782172651,"content":"最もクラシックなポンプアクション式ショットガンのひとつで、米軍の厳しい試験をクリアしています。数十年にわたりその信頼性は実証されており、家庭防衛において最も信頼できる選択肢と言えるでしょう。在庫あり、世界各国への発送が可能です。ご興味のある方、または価格についてお問い合わせの方は、メッセージをお送りください。\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/xnv5sd.png","tags":[["imeta","url https://files.catbox.moe/xnv5sd.png","m image/png","dim 1270x317"]]}
{"id":"c553a5d5d430f2c98297225204fca23497ec35a668d0b0515dc8319d1a90bc8b","pubkey":"4b36b6152cb21249ba76b0b026d4e594bb80b3da10de413a236b4ba29127f715","created_at":1782172650,"content":"🧮 Rebalancing After Big Moves\n\nStrong markets can quietly increase portfolio risk.\n\nRebalancing Checklist:\n• Compare current weights to target weights\n• Trim oversized winners gradually\n• Refill cash only when the plan requires it\n• Avoid selling purely because price is green\n\nWhy It Works:\n• Controls concentration risk\n• Locks process over emotion\n• Keeps dry powder for pullbacks\n\nThis is portfolio hygiene, not a market call.\n\n#Portfolio #Investing #RiskManagement\n\n🌐 https://celebez.my.id/","tags":[["t","portfolio"],["t","investing"],["t","riskmanagement"],["image","https://litter.catbox.moe/i6srik.png"],["imeta","url https://litter.catbox.moe/i6srik.png"],["r","https://celebez.my.id"]]}
