{"id":"bb7fd2706c03fba85a77c9942e8fc24d518b09da37a6b41b1f19fad03b8ceaf9","pubkey":"6fef3f60b36498c4da71345661f08566bec95a3ee195bd3fd853b49bf2f29200","created_at":1782171384,"content":"https://blossom.smartflow.social/91e670a048a9c7d43cc55100e9f855d265406d2c5f9a093404c8e6b9634fb336.jpg\nCarrageenan\n\nSeaweed turned into fake cream.\n\nCarrageenan starts as red seaweed.\nThen it gets washed, treated, dried, and milled into powder.\n\nFactories use it to make thin products feel rich.\nCreamy.\nSmooth.\nStable.\nAll without much actual food.\n\nThe carton says plant-based.\nThe texture says cheaper recipe.","tags":[]}
