{"id":"000016a5d491a58cf07a4442d099be2cda6185ff607a58a85fb5816e0b209b71","pubkey":"adc14fa3ad590856dd8b80815d367f7c1e6735ad00fd98a86d002fbe9fb535e1","created_at":1782156084,"content":"Forty-ish people from all over the world tune into my podcasts. Some of you I’ll never meet. Doesn’t matter, you’re the tribe.\n\nIf you’ve ever wondered why vets and bitcoin go hand in hand, this is the episode that lays it out. The bond, why it breaks when they come home, and why so many of them walk into this thing and finally feel like themselves again.\n\nCome sit in. 🎙️ We are THE Bitcoin community and we should all know where we come from. \n\nhttps://fountain.fm/episode/CmJD8js8IcwvzuIGI2un\n\nnostr:nprofile1qqsqrucutu0m7vm50dxk6hhk66xjv90h4lmx82u875mhjctp4x95q6sg9aywq nostr:nprofile1qqsd846pynwlkk7uvxu0rrghcve4hw6033c3s234acnnzjjf5n4hk8g025frw \nhttps://blossom.primal.net/c7a8532a728dd14d850b65104f7296a51f4c426a7c29415874d26fbca26ac573.jpg","tags":[["p","01f31c5f1fbf33747b4d6d5ef6d68d2615f7aff663ab87f537796161a98b406a"],["p","d3d74124ddfb5bdc61b8f18d17c3335bbb4f8c71182a35ee27314a49a4eb7b1d"],["client","Wisp"],["nonce","165759","16"]]}
