{"id":"42096d5d680a360b919c1d310d9f4eb1bef2d4d559a9832e09838d23e766f52e","pubkey":"1ec454734dcbf6fe54901ce25c0c7c6bca5edd89443416761fadc321d38df139","created_at":1782133910,"content":"Here is something fun to do today on NOSTR. \n\n\nStart an anonymous account. \nhttps://blossom.laantungir.net/930853bed8afe98a9b6228079458f44389d2c72a0e736026d1a30acc7670aaf1.jpg\nThink about privacy. Use TOR or a VPN, but don't worry about it too much. Don't overthink it. It is more important to start than to get too hung up on all the details. Just start one. \n\n\nMaybe post your meals. Maybe post art. The more specific the better.\n\n\nEnjoy the fact you don't have any followers. There is no pressure. You are free to post whatever you want. \n\n\nIf you really want to have fun, try designing the person you would like to become.\n\n\nYou can just become someone.","tags":[]}
