{"id":"f461d470abad337aa7b8279f84d1418306681cb5149ba5e78082a964b73f0eef","pubkey":"acd4a94e61471f3d478ae1dffe89040a3e90bdc07d4cfc1a55d25cb255df757a","created_at":1782133788,"content":"God, I trust You.\n\nI may not understand everything right now. I may not see the full answer yet. I may still be waiting, praying, and wondering what comes next.\n\nBut I trust that You are working. I trust that You know what is best for me. I trust that Your timing will never fail.\n\nSometimes, faith is not having every answer.\n\nSometimes, faith is simply saying, “Lord, I don’t know what’s next, but I trust You.”\n\n“Trust in the Lord with all your heart and lean not on your own understanding.” Proverbs 3:5\n\nMay your heart find peace in this truth:\n\nYou don’t have to figure everything out. God already sees the way ahead.\n\nGod, I trust You. 🙇🏻☝🏻\n\nhttps://npub14n22jnnpgu0n63u2u80lazgypglfp0wq04x0cxj46fwty4wlw4aqhvxfuu.blossom.band/e68acdd7fc80cba853a1740aace7bc917f578d9fdbbb8a85bfb107e90e91b299.jpg","tags":[["t","bch"],["t","bitcoincash"],["imeta","url https://npub14n22jnnpgu0n63u2u80lazgypglfp0wq04x0cxj46fwty4wlw4aqhvxfuu.blossom.band/e68acdd7fc80cba853a1740aace7bc917f578d9fdbbb8a85bfb107e90e91b299.jpg"],["client","BCHNostr","31990:df5bcaba9e74cc1764c9773ae160299dde5acf79416e2c96758dba225e6707cc:bchstr24-1","wss://relay.damus.io"]]}
