{"id":"11caee63fccc5081e39b3f20a1b3b1786e6e4af0def8fee68c96bd757676598b","pubkey":"314072c16fa9433e1374f62e5b02c8163946ed298a9cde3b1541513c29d19fff","created_at":1782132936,"content":"This vid is a good explainer of your question. To me as a BIP110 supporter a hard fork PoW change is a non-starter. At the same time if BIP-110 fails I firmly believe Bitcoin as we know it is over and it’s probably not coming back. You can’t have perfect money if your blocks are 40% non-monetary junk that competes with the monetary usecase. Bitcoin then becomes like silver is to gold and it will be demonetised in not too long. \n\nhttps://youtu.be/jVHM4iytiJk","tags":[["e","b4ce7f2178c2eeb591e09edcfbd61717a1f58954fd0a7f3cce4d0234d9ceed08","","root"],["p","af5aa898e8d13b6aef7a9f5a5e6f7e40c0fc5ae9ac3cf8301574e894488e4973","","mention"]]}
