{"id":"69ab01007db25417e6169e1f695f4af58695b2cfc405820865efa90a56df1a34","pubkey":"8d9d2b77930ee54ec3e46faf774ddd041dbb4e4aa35ad47c025884a286dd65fa","created_at":1782129209,"content":"Good morning nostr, this morning i woke up remembering how mondays were always hard for me when i still worked at the hospital.  I worked very long night shifts, usually weekend nights.  The emergency dept could get pretty crazy at night, then on mondays i would always be dragging all day, from the night hours and just exhaustion.  So glad i decided to leave that world.  Today should be just the usual stuff on the list, but i will enjoy my coffee and just be grateful.  Yall have a great monday, enjoy your coffee, and do your work with a happy heart. #coffeechain\nhttps://npub13kwjkaunpmj5aslyd7hhwnwaqswmknj25dddglqztzz29pkavhaq25wg2a.blossom.band/04915ba68af5064291272371f12d1d766155ba4a566005a8696828d0a1f44dcb.jpg","tags":[["t","coffeechain"],["imeta","url https://npub13kwjkaunpmj5aslyd7hhwnwaqswmknj25dddglqztzz29pkavhaq25wg2a.blossom.band/04915ba68af5064291272371f12d1d766155ba4a566005a8696828d0a1f44dcb.jpg","m image/jpeg","thumbhash WxgOBYLWhYdgdYh1l2eImFClArNp","dim 1920x1446"]]}
