{"id":"8dd55b86f28ddc3418ba0c53b2731d9b77ae4e0a06518ee961868f471a510d60","pubkey":"cec0f44d0d64d6d9d7a1c84c330f5467e752cc8b065f720e874a0bed1c5416d2","created_at":1782124924,"content":"Cashu-TS v4.6.0 just released - which includes a helper to make converting from NUT-18 payment request to P2PKOptions super simple.\n\nIt also strengthens proof creation checks to ensure wallets choose active, v1+ keysets, and brings deterministic DLEQ creation up to current NUT-12 spec.\n\nhttps://github.com/cashubtc/cashu-ts/releases/tag/v4.6.0\n https://blossom.primal.net/389c09c05ae99d078acb8f71d14b63ec4872ab6f32a726907dfac19c31a9ecd8.png ","tags":[["r","wss://sendit.nosflare.com/"],["r","wss://relay.snort.social/"],["r","wss://relay.primal.net/"],["r","wss://eden.nostr.land/"],["r","wss://purplepag.es/"],["r","wss://nos.lol/"],["r","wss://nostr.mom/"],["r","wss://nostr-pub.wellorder.net/"],["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/389c09c05ae99d078acb8f71d14b63ec4872ab6f32a726907dfac19c31a9ecd8.png","m image/png","dim 1254x1254","service nip96"],["client","Primal Web"]]}
