{"id":"87168bbb24cda1a7917f3e73e73e0255c341ac9c19a54e32bfb0a1f1c9610885","pubkey":"6b6e19ce47a917cbe13a67eeb4053a9b301e78ec991413e7554953088ed62d3b","created_at":1782124747,"content":"今のきもちは「なくした」の魚でした。\n\n【ドコイッタカレイ】\n探しものの近くを三回通り過ぎてから気づく。\n生息地：机の下海底\n\n#きもち魚鑑定\nhttps://kimochi-sakana-kantei.vercel.app/","tags":[["t","きもち魚鑑定"],["r","https://kimochi-sakana-kantei.vercel.app/"]]}
{"id":"7526f0a98c7cfb49f59a6702f6ec284aa9df7a400e010c86ca2f23312ce293cb","pubkey":"16d114303d8203115918ca34a220e925c022c09168175a5ace5e9f3b61640947","created_at":1782124732,"content":"https://nostr.download/7b7aed390eb1ce2c3135b1f6d54061f38be097682c4f353e85f23f84ff108fdc.jpg\nDamageBDD is the One Punch Man of software verification.\n\nNot because it is loud.\n\nBecause the whole fight ends when the test lands.\n\nEmpire builds complexity monsters.\n\nFramework monsters.\nProcess monsters.\nGovernance monsters.\nAI alignment monsters.\nCompliance monsters.\n\nThen DamageBDD walks in with one clean BDD:\n\nGiven the behavior was promised\nWhen the machine executes\nThen the truth is verified\n\nThat is the punch.\n\nNo committee can dodge it.\nNo roadmap can gaslight it.\nNo stochastic fog can explain it away.\n\nThe machine either did the thing,\nor it did not.\n\nDamageBDD does not need to look powerful.\n\nIt is powerful because even a child can read the witness.\n\n#DamageBDD #BDD #SoftwareTesting #Verification #OnePunchMan #ProgrammerLife #Erlang #Bitcoin #MachineTruth #BuildInPublic","tags":[["alt","A short note: https://nostr.download/7b7aed390eb1ce2c3135b1f6d54..."],["t","DamageBDD"],["t","damagebdd"],["t","BDD"],["t","bdd"],["t","SoftwareTesting"],["t","softwaretesting"],["t","Verification"],["t","verification"],["t","OnePunchMan"],["t","onepunchman"],["t","ProgrammerLife"],["t","programmerlife"],["t","Erlang"],["t","erlang"],["t","Bitcoin"],["t","bitcoin"],["t","MachineTruth"],["t","machinetruth"],["t","BuildInPublic"],["t","buildinpublic"],["r","https://nostr.download/7b7aed390eb1ce2c3135b1f6d54061f38be097682c4f353e85f23f84ff108fdc.jpg"],["imeta","url https://nostr.download/7b7aed390eb1ce2c3135b1f6d54061f38be097682c4f353e85f23f84ff108fdc.jpg","x 7b7aed390eb1ce2c3135b1f6d54061f38be097682c4f353e85f23f84ff108fdc","size 261514","m image/jpeg","dim 1024x1536","blurhash ^EE.kS4.JBnhNHt6~qkDNFxWbbRj?vslxakXIUWX%g-oRiI;V?ay%MxuM{M|%1t6_3M|Rkt8M|oeTKxvM{-oWBRk%1M_xat7M|ofIpof%1e.WBt7","ox 7b7aed390eb1ce2c3135b1f6d54061f38be097682c4f353e85f23f84ff108fdc"],["client","Amethyst"]]}
