{"id":"51184875ae41558dc74988faa981afa29cc1caf9ae49529fd25c9ce64e2d2b4c","pubkey":"38485711b4c98ad9deb5522ae7a33dbf13f5b2c79a9a3e68164a93979732ff36","created_at":1782108156,"content":"製品名：アムネシアウォーター（溺水），仕様：10ml/ボトル，価格：75U，服用量：1回につき1/3，説明：男女兼用。服用者は誰でも意識を失います。嫌いな相手に飲ませて、深い眠りに落ちた後の困惑した様子を観察しましょう。無色無臭なので、水、飲み物、ビールなどに混ぜるだけでOK。最大のセールスポイントは（睡眠中の記憶喪失と意識消失）です。彼女はあなたが何をしたのか全く分かりません。副作用はなく、少なくとも3時間は眠ることができ、完全にあなたの思い通りになります。コンドームを着用して、大胆かつ自信を持ってプレイしましょう。在庫数に限りがあります。日本国内限定販売です。デートレイプドラッグが必要な方は、個別にご連絡ください。\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/ynplvk.jpg","tags":[["imeta","url https://files.catbox.moe/ynplvk.jpg","m image/jpeg","dim 768x576"]]}
{"id":"234701b386b5bf862bfc6ff408b21057cd50009f65556b499f69eab45e88930d","pubkey":"f4885c4280973cd6b7c256057e8c9ece382652aac8f284549dc74cb4e20c568f","created_at":1782108156,"content":"📰 XRP Price Prediction as CLARITY Act Nears President’s Desk\n🗓️ Jun 21 2026 13:38 UTC - About Author\n\nXRP price holds near $1.14 as CLARITY Act progress, ETF inflows, and $1.20 resistance shape the next market move.\n\n➤ The XRP price is trading near $1.14, influenced by the progress of the CLARITY Act and resistance at $1.20, with low trading volume indicating cautious market sentiment.\n➤ The CLARITY Act faces significant hurdles in the Senate, with a vote before the August recess uncertain, impacting potential institutional assessment of tokenized settlement and payment infrastructure.\n➤ Despite weak price action, XRP ETF inflows remain positive, and institutional exposure is active, though widespread adoption of XRP in tokenized Treasury settlement pilots is hindered by a lack of legal clarity.\n\n#xrp #clarityact #tokenizedtreasurysettlement #regulatoryclarity #xrpetf #institutionaladoption #priceprediction #senatevote #ripple\n\n🔗 Read more at: https://rwatimes.io/articles/coingape-xrp-price-prediction-as-clarity-act-nears-presidents-desk-3961493071","tags":[]}
