{"id":"e63520dbec177b23f84155f2071dc807c25a93a761ac871b7d808de141fa5334","pubkey":"1ea1e20949937cfcdb34e2d6933f3bcf358c967980b7817d24539ce6f52b6395","created_at":1782108155,"content":"📰 Philippines SEC Says Its RWA Tokenization Framework Is Ready\n🗓️ Jun 21 2026 22:49 UTC - Aleksandar Dukic\n\nPhilippines SEC Commissioner Rogelio Quevedo says the regulator's real-world-asset tokenization framework is ready, putting Manila among the first SE Asian markets with live rules.\n\n➤ The Philippines SEC has announced its framework for tokenized real-world assets (RWAs) is ready, positioning the country as an early adopter in Southeast Asia.\n➤ This move signifies a shift from regulatory study to a defined rulebook for issuing, distributing, and trading on-chain assets, with key details pending on asset classification and custody.\n➤ The framework aims to leverage the Philippines' large remittance market and tech-savvy population, potentially integrating tokenized assets with digital wallets and payment systems.\n\n#philippinessec #rwatokenization #frameworkready #seasianmarkets #onchainassets #securitiesclassification #custodyandsettlement #remittancecorridors #digitalwallets #tokenizedfunds\n\n🔗 Read more at: https://rwatimes.io/articles/spendnode-philippines-sec-says-its-rwa-tokenization-framework-is-ready-1444984426","tags":[]}
{"id":"d04f9b360a416d6edbb0f4c65ccba27ada0f7aa26eaa6c68b295c84e419942a1","pubkey":"1ea1e20949937cfcdb34e2d6933f3bcf358c967980b7817d24539ce6f52b6395","created_at":1782108154,"content":"📰 Ripple News: XRPL Stablecoin Transfers Hit $5.1B as RWA Inflows Lead Major Blockchains\n🗓️ Jun 21 2026 19:14 UTC - Moses K\n\nRipple News: XRPL stablecoin transfers hit $5.11B in 30 days as RLUSD, Ondo fund, and $1.9B RWA inflows drive growth.\n\n➤ XRP Ledger (XRPL) has seen a significant surge in stablecoin transfers, reaching $5.11 billion in 30 days, driven by increased usage of Ripple USD (RLUSD) and tokenized assets.\n➤ XRPL has emerged as a leading blockchain for Real-World Asset (RWA) inflows, attracting $1.9 billion over 90 days, surpassing Ethereum and Stellar in net inflows.\n➤ The growth is further bolstered by the Ondo Short-Term U.S. Government Bond Fund's activity on XRPL, indicating increasing institutional interest in tokenized traditional assets.\n\n#xrpl #stablecoin #rwa #ondofund #tokenizedtreasury #rippleusdrlusd #xrpledger #institutionalinflows #blockchain\n\n🔗 Read more at: https://rwatimes.io/articles/themarketperiodical-ripple-news-xrpl-stablecoin-transfers-hit-5-1-b-as-rwa-inflows-lead-major-blockchains-1612100876","tags":[]}
