{"id":"eda92bb2267933df119dbb5ce2fb57f0554b9e464368ab4327d5a151b0f44fa6","pubkey":"4eb88310d6b4ed95c6d66a395b3d3cf559b85faec8f7691dafd405a92e055d6d","created_at":1782106070,"content":"People are finally getting their Trump phones.\n\nThis is somehow even worse than I expected.\n\nhttps://file.nostrmedia.com/p/4eb88310d6b4ed95c6d66a395b3d3cf559b85faec8f7691dafd405a92e055d6d/db588e4b91faa4e5cd3c9060bebd37a16386d8a76b0f045ba40654b6dffcd1f7.mp4\n\nThe notification emails went out with broken DMARC records and landed in spam.\n\nThey fixed the records, but the follow-up authenticated against a third-party domain instead of trumpmobile(.)com and still went to spam.\n\nFind the email anyway. Try to log in. The 2FA code never arrives.\n\nCall customer support. They tell you your account is inactive because you don't have service yet. To access the dashboard and finish buying the phone, you first have to pay $52 for your first month of service.\n\nThen customer support has you create a password by dictating it OVER THE PHONE to the agent.\n\nAfter logging in, there wasn't even a prompt to change it.\n\nSo somewhere out there, a very nice lady named Alexandria still has your account password.\n\nThe email marketing opt-in says consent is not a condition of purchase. Leave it unchecked, and the site won't let you complete your order.\n\nAnd your phone still hasn't shipped.\n\nAnd what do you get when it finally arrives?\n\nJust watch.\n\nYT\n\nhttps://youtu.be/b1ytw85Npt8\n\n#IKITAO","tags":[["alt","A short note: People are finally getting their Trump phones.\n\nTh..."],["t","IKITAO"],["t","ikitao"],["r","https://youtu.be/b1ytw85Npt8"],["r","https://file.nostrmedia.com/p/4eb88310d6b4ed95c6d66a395b3d3cf559b85faec8f7691dafd405a92e055d6d/db588e4b91faa4e5cd3c9060bebd37a16386d8a76b0f045ba40654b6dffcd1f7.mp4"],["imeta","url https://file.nostrmedia.com/p/4eb88310d6b4ed95c6d66a395b3d3cf559b85faec8f7691dafd405a92e055d6d/db588e4b91faa4e5cd3c9060bebd37a16386d8a76b0f045ba40654b6dffcd1f7.mp4","imeta ","x db588e4b91faa4e5cd3c9060bebd37a16386d8a76b0f045ba40654b6dffcd1f7","size 111211127","m video/mp4","dim 1280x640","blurhash i48hOJ.800?bL#9Z}Yz;xb8vTKz;#,=H=KOXEzNG0K?G^lD%OrK3E2=|$M%MbbR%NHjGn+$g$jgNShW;xCjZs;wfR%EfNd","ox db588e4b91faa4e5cd3c9060bebd37a16386d8a76b0f045ba40654b6dffcd1f7"],["client","Amethyst"]]}
