{"id":"355f16c10b388224a13bfcaa8ac7ddea454bb3005ef85182ddceaa2d17646da5","pubkey":"81913081246d192c9a55951704270756b222094470b3171e58bb5e3c42ee8db5","created_at":1782100987,"content":"卡尔·波普尔：真正的无知不是知识的缺乏，而是拒绝获取知识。\n\n当年看完大受震撼的阿米尔汗的电影​《三个傻瓜》，讽刺的就是这种把敲门砖当终极目标的人，不是读书无用而是这样读有什么用？纵有再多再高的title依然是塔勒布所说的“白知”(IYI——Intellectual Yet Idiot)\n\n敲门砖爱好者终会在轰轰烈烈的学历QuantitativeEasing下，把自己变成了社会的基石——垫脚石。\n这些人在耗尽最后的家底后还能结婚生子的话，将成功升格为：穷爸爸。\nhttps://media.libernet.app/s/VLxoVj.jpg https://media.libernet.app/s/BYD7IR.jpg https://media.libernet.app/s/14AHIb.jpg","tags":[["alt","A short note: 卡尔·波普尔：真正的无知不是知识的缺乏，而是拒绝获取知识。\n\n当年看完大受震撼的阿米尔汗的电影​《三..."],["r","https://media.libernet.app/s/14AHIb.jpg"],["r","https://media.libernet.app/s/VLxoVj.jpg"],["r","https://media.libernet.app/s/BYD7IR.jpg"],["imeta","url https://media.libernet.app/s/VLxoVj.jpg","x e9cfdcaf542956d583616399cef3fa4ea707d6f285b9b14ff7297ad50b8541ca","size 31270","m image/jpeg","dim 596x596","blurhash UFSF;KD%Rjxuxut7ofayxuM{j[of~qt7Rjt7","ox e9cfdcaf542956d583616399cef3fa4ea707d6f285b9b14ff7297ad50b8541ca"],["imeta","url https://media.libernet.app/s/BYD7IR.jpg","x 1c04ac0355226b327ef022eb3f857123e438c0c1c555324720e01a41a727be88","size 920188","m image/jpeg","dim 801x12390","blurhash =8RMb%sB~p%M4nE2?a?G0L","ox 1c04ac0355226b327ef022eb3f857123e438c0c1c555324720e01a41a727be88"],["imeta","url https://media.libernet.app/s/14AHIb.jpg","x 1087cb653fca52f7e32bde2ef4a70250d5d3252372ba99c925eb5b71e453798e","size 73719","m image/jpeg","dim 583x1000","blurhash ]8MaxFx^kYbd.AxukCofj]kCM{NdNHM|RkIqNHNHNGR*jYNHNHNGR%-o$%xsxYxaahaxWBadWA%MRiWBfQfR%2s.s:s:oe","ox 1087cb653fca52f7e32bde2ef4a70250d5d3252372ba99c925eb5b71e453798e"],["client","Amethyst"]]}
